        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/x-metal/{size}/4892_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-07-03T15:06:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My question is why didn't the freedin five or something go Unlimited? You know, when the ranks expand dramatically to include tons of heroes. Like in the Jutsice League cartoon</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
